WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
From images and text to coordinated mechanisms.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Connections and geometry determine how the assembly moves.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:37.000
A shared kinematic graph connects construction, solving, and correction.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Linkages, transmissions, and everyday mechanisms. Scotch yoke motion is shown from the front.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Hydraulic scissor lift: MARC and Articraft outputs generated separately with the same backbone.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:20.000
On the same initial candidates, correction raises valid motion coverage from 54.1% to 67.8%, and overall success from 40% to 60%.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:30.000
MARC: Mechanism-Aware Reflective Correction for Articulated Object Code Generation.
